  "id": "buprenorphine",
  "term": "buprenorphine",
  "definition": "Buprenorphine is a synthetic opioid-related drug that partly activates mu-opioid receptors and blocks kappa-opioid receptors in the central nervous system. It has pain-relieving and sedating effects, and may also reduce increased pain sensitivity and have antidepressant effects.",
